# Copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev` (git ignores it). Nothing here is real: placeholders only.
# In production, each is a Worker secret: `wrangler secret put <NAME>` (docs/remote-access.md).

# The push relay (#398): an Apple Developer key with APNs (the .p8 file's text, with its newlines),
# its Key ID and the team's ID, and at least 32 random characters every pushSecret is made from.
APNS_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\npaste-the-p8-key-here\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----"
APNS_KEY_ID=paste-the-key-id-here
APNS_TEAM_ID=paste-the-team-id-here
PUSH_SECRET_KEY=paste-32-or-more-random-characters-here
